# Build context = THE REPOSITORY ROOT, so these paths are written from there.
# Everything a container has no business carrying — and, first, everything it must never
# carry off this machine.

# Children's photographs, school footage, and the biometrics computed from them. The
# .gitignore names these for the same reason; a build context is another way to copy a
# directory somewhere it should not go.
student_photos/
original_student_photos/
*_student_photos/
**/media/
**/data/
**/logs/
**/.cache/
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.npz
*.npy
*.pkl
roster.csv
eval/clips/
eval/crops/
**/eval/clips/
**/eval/crops/

# The offline analyser. It runs on a machine with a GPU, never in this container, and it
# pulls torch and ultralytics — the AGPL dependency `classvision/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md`
# keeps deliberately out of anything network-served.
classvision/

# Model weights: hundreds of megabytes the dashboard never loads.
*.pt
*.onnx

# Secrets. Railway supplies configuration as environment variables; a baked .env would both
# leak and silently outrank them.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.railway.example

# Local tooling and caches.
.venv*/
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
.git/
.DS_Store
out/

# Development-only material.
**/tests/
**/docs/
qorgan-ai-main/deploy/*.bat
qorgan-ai-main/deploy/*.ps1
qorgan-ai-main/deploy/*.xml

# ДАННЫЕ СТЕНДА: единственное место, откуда база и кадры ПОПАДАЮТ в образ. Правила выше
# по-прежнему держат их снаружи везде, кроме этой папки. Docker берёт последнее совпавшее
# правило, поэтому исключение стоит в конце файла — переставите выше, и оно перестанет
# работать молча.
!qorgan-ai-main/seed/
!qorgan-ai-main/seed/**
